# Cloud entry: pick ONE real access control and copy to browser-gate.caddy.
# Samgita has no browser login, and gate A11 is open, so never leave this empty.
#
# A) Identity-aware proxy (oauth2-proxy, Authelia, ...):
# forward_auth 127.0.0.1:4180 {
# 	uri /oauth2/auth
# }
#
# B) Fixed client addresses (office, VPN egress):
# @outside not remote_ip 203.0.113.10/32
# respond @outside 403
#
# Until one is chosen, deny everything:
respond 403
